(7807004, 1303168, 772, '<td valign="top">
Excellent photograph.  This one hits home with me because I''m a BBQ junkie.  My ''party deck'' out back is covered with grills and smokers.  Sometimes on days I''m not cooking out there, i''ll fire one of them up just for some aromatherapy.  Looks like someone is putting together some sliced brisket sammiches there maybe...  BBQ is so very ''cultural'' here in the US... it''s hard to keep up with all of the variants... Texas, Kansas City, Memphis, North/South Carolina.... there are about 4 different variations just within the Carolinas, especially with the sauce options.  I''m gonna go out on a limb and guess that you aren''t in Texas :)  But I''d hit that sammich head first and not come up for air :)</td>', 'Excellent photograph.  This one hits home with me because I''m a BBQ junkie.  My ''party deck'' out back is covered with grills and smokers.  Sometimes on days I''m not cooking out there, i''ll fire one of them up just for some aromatherapy.  Looks like someone is putting together some sliced brisket sammiches there maybe...  BBQ is so very ''cultural'' here in the US... it''s hard to keep up with all of the variants... Texas, Kansas City, Memphis, North/South Carolina.... there are about 4 different variations just within the Carolinas, especially with the sauce options.  I''m gonna go out on a limb and guess that you aren''t in Texas :)  But I''d hit that sammich head first and not come up for air :)', '2026-01-08 15:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
